                       "description":  "The Phase Timeline is a window into the loop controller\u0027s structured PhaseResult output. The controller builds one PhaseResult after each phase executor returns (setup, verification, agentic, completion) at four insertion points in loop_controller.rs and loop_handlers.rs, persists it via save_phase_result, and emits it on the Tauri \u0027phase-result\u0027 event. Persistence and emit both key on get_parent_task_id(\u0026config.execution_id) so composed-run children surface under their parent task_run. Correctness assertions describe what the persisted data must look like on the page — deviations indicate bugs in the loop controller\u0027s mapping logic, not the UI.",
